      <TableCell>IPVRF contains the IP-VRF configuration for Layer 3 EVPN. This field is required for Layer3 topology and optional for Layer2 topology.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>macVRF</code></TableCell>
